    "created_at": "2019-12-18T15:10:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-12-18T15:10:24Z",
    "body": "I think that boils down to the question of how much security we should allow HTTP sites to pretend to have. If I could go back in time and kick myself in the butt about allowing SRI and CSP for HTTP pages, I would. :)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
