    "created_at": "2019-12-20T13:19:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-12-20T13:19:35Z",
    "body": "I think it's a valid point that CORP cannot be restricted to secure contexts as that would make secure resources less secure.\r\n\r\nNot convinced that COOP or COEP should not require secure contexts though. (This thread did make me wonder whether we should have `X-Frame-Options: secure-only` or some such.)",
